 "context": "<div data-type=\"note\" data-has-label=\"true\" id=\"fs-id2571408\" class=\"interactive-embedded-homework\" data-label=\"\">\n<div data-type=\"title\">Link to Learning</div>\n<span data-type=\"media\" id=\"fs-id3034748\" data-alt=\"QR Code representing a URL\">\n<img src=\"https://openstax.org/apps/archive/20240910.161227/resources/364bce8d2e94acd383c98f022a273abf9773889f\" data-media-type=\"image/png\" alt=\"QR Code representing a URL\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\">\n</span>\n<p id=\"fs-id2024284\">Watch this collection of interview clips with biofilm researchers in “What Are Bacterial Biofilms?”\n\n</p>\n<div data-type=\"media\" id=\"eip-id1167232076592\" data-alt=\"bacteria_biofilm\">\n<div class=\"os-has-iframe os-has-link\" data-type=\"switch\">\n<a class=\"os-is-link\" href=\"https://openstax.org/books/biology/pages/9-4-signaling-in-single-celled-organisms\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" data-media=\"print\">Access multimedia content</a>\n<iframe width=\"660\" height=\"371.4\" src=\"https://www.openstaxcollege.org/l/bacteria_bioflm\" class=\"os-is-iframe\" data-media=\"screen\"><!-- no-selfclose --></iframe>\n</div>\n                 </div>\n</div>",
